DreamingOS is provided as a multi-license source tree.

The OpenWrt baseline is provided under:

	SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

according to the text in:

	LICENSES/GPL-2.0

Other licenses also apply to individual files and components. SPDX identifiers,
copyright notices, component license files, and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md identify
those terms. No repository-wide license statement overrides a more specific
license attached to a file or component.

DreamingOS-authored components under package/lester are licensed as declared in
their package metadata and source headers. Derived third-party files retain their
original notices and license requirements.
